WEBVTT

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:40.460
I put my ear down to the ground

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:46.930
tried to hear what the old roots say

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.910
I put my ear down to the ground

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:04.750
tried to hear what the old roots say

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:15.700
Ain't no silence down there, brother

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:22.510
there's a world going on today

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:33.570
Signals running through the dark

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:40.100
tree to tree without a sound

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:50.350
Signals running through the dark

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:57.890
tree to tree without a sound

00:02:04.920 --> 00:02:08.920
A million years of talking low

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:15.240
deep beneath this ground

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:02.860
When the dry wind hits the forest

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:08.580
somebody sends the warning out

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:18.700
When the dry wind hits the forest

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:26.580
somebody sends the warning out

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:36.210
Carbon flows and water follows

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:42.670
that's what life is all about

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:56.160
We put our sensors in the soil

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:03.110
we started listening too

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:11.510
We put our sensors in the soil

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:20.510
we started listening too

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:27.920
And what we heard down in the dark

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:34.480
it changed our point of view

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:45.680
We're listening together now

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:51.410
you and me and all the trees

00:04:56.920 --> 00:05:00.920
We're listening together now

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:09.500
you and me and all the trees

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:17.210
Maybe that's the oldest wisdom

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:24.250
learning how to just be
